  "decoy_notes": [
    "Expected names include PeptideIndexing fallback DECOY_ prefix on failed DecoyHelper inference.",
    "Detected affix counts are case-insensitive, but returned spelling comes from the last occurrence and final accession classification is case-sensitive.",
    "Prefix and suffix observations can count the same accession twice. Equal aggregate prefix/suffix counts cause failure even when one candidate otherwise qualifies.",
    "Prefix candidates are checked before suffix candidates, regardless of which side has more total observations.",
    "Suffix regex repeats the last letter of each affix except random; it does not support arbitrary trailing underscores. Prefix alternation order gives reverse priority over reversed."
  ],
