  "enzyme_notes": [
    "Source FoundProteinFunctor always ignores missed-cleavage count.",
    "N-terminal extension removes either M or any MX from a protein beginning M; it happens before enzyme-specific full-product checks.",
    "X!Tandem adds D|P terminal cleavage even for no-cleavage enzyme. MSGF+ changes Trypsin to Trypsin/P across all runs if any run reports this engine."
  ]
